WEBVTT

00:14:58.477 --> 00:15:00.103
or how much money you make

00:15:00.103 --> 00:15:02.856
or the color of your skin

00:15:02.856 --> 00:15:04.900
or the person you love

00:15:04.900 --> 00:15:07.194
or the pronouns you use.

00:15:07.194 --> 00:15:10.364
These are universal
fundamental human rights,

00:15:10.405 --> 00:15:13.617
and they ought to be guaranteed in law,

00:15:13.659 --> 00:15:14.826
in the Constitution,

00:15:14.868 --> 00:15:19.289
so the Supreme Court
cannot willy-nilly take them away.

00:15:19.873 --> 00:15:26.463
(Applause)

00:15:26.505 --> 00:15:28.256
Now to do this,

00:15:28.298 --> 00:15:31.718
we need to elect champions for choice